Opt-in exact GDN states at periodic retention boundaries inside each prefill,
in addition to the existing final reusable hash checkpoint. Coordinate
reservation, worker metadata and export; preserve the default-off path.

Reuses the numerically verified exporter from cd37c261a1a2 (#425); multiple
interior states address the deep-divergence criterion that version lacked.

Kind: feature
What: opt-in CUDA Triton/FLA GDN multi-checkpoint prefill export and allocation for deep-divergence prefix reuse
Upstream: syv-ai/HyperQwen #392 and #425 (closed single-checkpoint version)
Cut-against: 0.33.0: Triton-only opt-in; upstream FlashInfer checkpoint planning/export stays unchanged
Retires-when: upstream GDN exports and allocates equivalent periodic interior states

